# kyo-test discovers suites through this ServiceLoader registry and nowhere else — its CLI runner takes no suite
# arguments. A suite missing from this list does not fail; it silently never runs.
#
# KbMetaSpec asserts that this file and the classes in KbTests.scala agree, so the omission is caught rather than
# quietly tolerated. Add the suite here when you add it there.
KbParsingSpec
KbPathsSpec
KbScaffoldSpec
KbIntentSpec
KbCheckSpec
KbIndexSpec
KbMetaSpec
